= What ran

`baseline_v1/run_ps0.sh` on `main` \@ `4b6e09b78` plus this PR's diff (Conductor task T-4). Reference: `semaev_decomp::decompose` (one-word field, `gcd(q, L_V mod q)`), harness `examples/pdp_speedup`. Rungs $l in {8,...,12}$, $n = 3l$, curve $y^2 + x y = x^3 + x^2 + 1$ (slugs in the baseline README). Host: Intel Xeon \@ 2.80 GHz KVM guest, 4 vCPU, AVX-512F/BW, PCLMULQDQ, no cpufreq control. Isolation: `tools/isolated_bench.py run --cpus 3` (a shared container, not the repository's receipt service), 0 of 50 timed runs marked contended; one refused start (pre-flight, my own polling) with no run and no record. Corpus: 64 uniform and 16 planted targets per rung, SplitMix64 seed $20261011 + l$, regenerated byte-identical in a second run. Raw records: `baseline_v1/raw/{times,iso}.jsonl`, `baseline_v1/opcount/counts.jsonl`, `baseline_v1/callgrind/`.

