Verdict and root-set digests are identical in three replays per rung (`baseline_v1/digests.txt`); root sets agree with a brute-force walk of every sorted triple on all 80 targets at $l = 8$ and the first 16 at $l = 9$. All 153 roots found over the five rungs re-add to $plus.minus R$ in the group.

= Missing or not done

Brute-force cross-check at $l >= 10$ not run. Callgrind at $l >= 10$ not run (only $l = 8, 9$ were requested). The baseline binary is hashed in `manifest.json` but not committed. No speedup is claimed; this report records the reference only.
